Patient: Hey.
Patient: Pretty good at the moment, actually. Like, it previously that has been an issue, but, um.
Patient: Other than, sort of, physically feeling a bit.
Patient: Uh, crappy, I've.
Patient: Yeah, in a pretty good place.
Doctor: Apart from that rash, any other rashes on your skin, or swelling of your joints, or pain in your joints?
Patient: Uh, yeah, sort of aching shoulders, back, the hips, knees, but sort of, yeah. Not,
Doctor: Any swelling that you've noticed?
Patient: No,.
Doctor: Your hands, wrists, ankles, toes.
Patient: Uh, no.
