summary is: {{ 1/48 of diarrhea with 5-6 episodes of loose watery stools. No blood in the stools. No abdominal pain. No fever. No vomiting initially but has settled now. Unable to eat and drink well. Feeling dehydrated. Has had some nausea initially but settled now. No headache. No myalgia. No chest pain. No shortness of breath. No cough. No recent sick contacts. No recent change in diet or medication. No similar episodes in the past. No family history of IBD. Patient is a software engineer. Lives alone. Non smoker and drinks alcohol occasionally. 

PMH: Asthma. 

DH: Asthma inhaler. 

SH: Father had bowel cancer 10 years ago. Mother has diabetes type 2. 

Imp: Gastroenteritis. 

Plan: To continue to drink plenty of fluids and take paracetamol as needed. To take time off work for next 2 days. Review in a week if no improvement. }}<|eot_id|>
