summary is: {{ 1. General
The patient is a 35-year-old male, working as a lawyer in London. He has noticed a change in his health since changing his job. He feels hot, severe headaches, reduced appetite, tingling in his arms, palpitations and has lost 5lbs unintentionally.
2. Headaches
Headaches are present when he is working on his computer. They are not at a specific time of the day. They are in the front of his head. They are associated with nausea. He is not sick. They are 7/10. He is not sure if they are getting worse. They are not relieved with paracetamol. They are affecting his work. He is not taking any medications. There is no neck stiffness.
3. Reduced appetite
He has reduced appetite. He has lost 5lbs unintentionally. He is not exercising. He is not feeling looser in his clothes. No one has commented on his weight loss. He is eating out.
4. Tingling in the arms
The tingling is in both hands. It is more in the morning. It is when he is in the lift. It is not present in his legs. It is a pins and needles type sensation.
5. Shortness of breath
He feels short of breath. He is not sure if it is related to his heart rate. It is not when he is exercising. It is when he is sitting at his desk. It is not at night. It is not related to his thyroid. He is not on any medications.
6. Palpitations
He feels his heart beating. It is not when he is exercising. It is not at a specific time of the day. It is once a day. It is not associated with headaches. It is not related to his thyroid. He is not on any medications.
7. Loss of libido
He has noticed a loss of libido at home.
8. Past medical history
He has hyperthyroidism. He is on thyroxine. He is not allergic to anything. He is a smoker. He drinks alcohol once a week. He does not take recreational drugs. He is not on any medications.
9. Examination
He is a well-looking man. He is not in distress. He is not pale. He is not dehydrated. He has good peripheral perfusion. He is not tachycardic. He has a regular rhythm. He has no murmurs. He has good air entry bilaterally. He has no crepitations. He has no }}<|eot_id|>
